  { title: 'No fallback, even when you leave.', text: `One CloudFront setup "cannot fall back to your origin" when the Agent Site is down, so visitors get an error (${a(T.aws, 'AWS')}). TollBit's docs have no offboarding page; see "Plan the exit", below.` },
  { title: 'Bots that hide their name get through.', text: `"We primarily focus on the big, self-identified bots" (${a(T.botManagement, 'Bot management')}). A bot that isn't on the list, or sends a browser's name, reaches your origin.` },
  { title: 'The bot list goes stale.', text: `TollBit updates it "every quarter", and "publishers would then manually update their edge configurations" on most platforms (${a(T.botManagement, 'Bot management')}).` },
];

