  { title: 'It runs on more of your platforms.', text: `TollBit has setup guides for 12 platforms: CDNs, clouds, hosts and bot-security vendors. On Arc XP, WordPress VIP, DataDome and Netacea, forwarding bots is a setting in that vendor's console (${a(T.integrations, 'Integrations')}). FORA's publisher console sets up two networks, Cloudflare and AWS CloudFront (${a('/getting-started/publisher-onboarding/', 'Publisher onboarding')}).` },
