  </Band>

  <Band tone="light" label="The differences, question by question" title="Eight questions a publisher asks of any licensing deal" lead={'TollBit is ahead on what you see; FORA on how you can price and on who can check a pass. The first three rows compare different jobs. Both license your pages to AI buyers, and they can share your CDN.'}>
